{"schema_version":"1.0.0","document_id":"6f09db1b349d55073e7ab96b5305b46bf693106fe7b109cb863bdbeb3c17d440","company_key":"yc-acunote","company_name":"Acunote","source_id":"yc-acunote-news-import-fc65b5e5f495","source_kind":"html","canonical_url":"https://www.acunote.com/blog/2010/11/google-apps-user-management.html","observed_url":"https://www.acunote.com/blog/2010/11/google-apps-user-management.html","title":"Google Apps User Management","summary":"","body_text":"Now it is very simple to link your Google Apps users to Acunote using our new Google Apps User Management page. It uses Google Apps user provisioning API so first you should grant Acunote access to it. Please go to Acunote application details page on your Google Apps domain management page and click Grant data access link in the Data access section. Later you can find this page in Google Apps Integration section of your organization profile.","published_at":"2010-11-11T00:00:00+00:00","first_seen_at":"2026-07-24T14:19:11.091402+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-07-28T21:33:52.463534+00:00","last_updated_at":"2026-08-19T20:44:00.912299+00:00","content_hash":"sha256:a0ebd6d20ca3c3890a54e9a3491e9d4b787c435c9d074ba3366ea6c1d60d5434","article_path":"articles/v1/6d/yc-acunote/2010/11/6f/6f09db1b349d55073e7ab96b5305b46bf693106fe7b109cb863bdbeb3c17d440/article.md","record_path":"articles/v1/6d/yc-acunote/2010/11/6f/6f09db1b349d55073e7ab96b5305b46bf693106fe7b109cb863bdbeb3c17d440/record.json"}
{"schema_version":"1.0.0","document_id":"81bc05925fa00c843bec1bc9e8289b486e9262c843c4c8a3dbf608b5765789cf","company_key":"yc-directed-edge","company_name":"Directed Edge","source_id":"yc-directed-edge-rss-7c8e8fe81473","source_kind":"rss","canonical_url":"https://blog.directededge.com/2010/11/29/whats-happening/","observed_url":"https://blog.directededge.com/2010/11/29/whats-happening/","title":"What’s happening?","summary":"So, the blog has been a bit silent of late, mostly because there’s been a lot of incremental stuff that’s been happening. We shout that stuff out over at Twitter and Facebook, but we’ll pull some of the last couple-o-months together here. But while I still have you attention: We need Rails beta testers. If […]","body_text":"So, the blog has been a bit silent of late, mostly because there’s been a lot of incremental stuff that’s been happening. We shout that stuff out over at Twitter and Facebook , but we’ll pull some of the last couple-o-months together here. But while I still have you attention: We need Rails beta testers. If you’ve been thinking about adding recommendations to your Rails app, drop us a line now . So, with that out of the way, a few of the things that have gone down in Directed Edge-land of late: We’ve been ramping up the features in our Shopify app based on things that we’ve been hearing from customers. The Shopify folks covered our new automagic bundling feature here . New version of our Ruby gem, 0.2.1 out , and a couple of features added to our Java bindings so that they approachÂ parityÂ with the other bindings. Wener Vogels, CTO of Amazon, has been spreading the good news about Directed Edge and we caught up with him when he was presenting about AWS in Berlin. Yours truly will be doing a big tour out through New York, Austin and San Francisco / Silicon Valley in December and January.Â HollerÂ if you want to meet and talk about recommendations. Werner Vogels presenting Directed Edge as \"one of the building blocks of Cloud Computing\" While a lot of the stuff in the last few months has been focused on internal tools and run-of-the-mill growing pains stuff, we’re getting pretty close to a series of announcements about new stuff coming down the pipe. (For some reason those always seem to come in batches.) We’re hoping the first of those will be ready in the next week or so.","published_at":"2010-11-30T05:55:55+00:00","first_seen_at":"2026-07-27T01:55:50.875550+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-08-20T02:30:11.821086+00:00","last_updated_at":"2026-08-20T02:30:11.924823+00:00","content_hash":"sha256:9f7996992a1f30fc75426b19a08116428d5081a6db973a4028fe6dac03c03b1b","article_path":"articles/v1/0e/yc-directed-edge/2010/11/81/81bc05925fa00c843bec1bc9e8289b486e9262c843c4c8a3dbf608b5765789cf/article.md","record_path":"articles/v1/0e/yc-directed-edge/2010/11/81/81bc05925fa00c843bec1bc9e8289b486e9262c843c4c8a3dbf608b5765789cf/record.json"}
{"schema_version":"1.0.0","document_id":"85a1b497433afc55e0fc98f12f9b7b953266d9f57e76dd3da31b16437e41ee42","company_key":"bridgford-foods-corporation-common-stock","company_name":"Bridgford Foods Corporation","source_id":"bridgford-foods-corporation-common-stock-news-import-93009f6f87a2","source_kind":"html","canonical_url":"https://www.globenewswire.com/news-release/2010/11/10/434085/12102/en/bridgford-foods-corporation-declares-cash-dividend.html","observed_url":"https://www.globenewswire.com/news-release/2010/11/10/434085/12102/en/bridgford-foods-corporation-declares-cash-dividend.html","title":"Bridgford Foods Corporation Declares Cash Dividend","summary":"ANAHEIM, Calif., Nov. 10, 2010 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- Bridgford Foods Corporation (Nasdaq:BRID) today announced that its Board of Directors has approved a...","body_text":"ANAHEIM, Calif., Nov. 10, 2010 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- Bridgford Foods Corporation (Nasdaq:BRID) today announced that its Board of Directors has approved a one-time cash dividend of $0.10 per share of common stock for shareholders of record on November 23, 2010, payable on December 20, 2010, based on operations to date for fiscal year 2010. Bridgford Foods Corporation is currently preparing its 2010 annual report and will distribute copies to shareholders when completed. Bridgford Foods Corporation is a producer of frozen dough, microwaveable sandwiches, dry sausage, processed meats and other convenience food products. The Bridgford Foods Corporation logo is available at http://www.globenewswire.com/newsroom/prs/?pkgid=6840","published_at":"2010-11-10T17:30:00+00:00","first_seen_at":"2026-07-27T00:05:26.022228+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-07-28T21:33:52.463534+00:00","last_updated_at":"2026-08-19T20:51:43.326899+00:00","content_hash":"sha256:fdbc1e436f9642cd5c6b0f24ad5152d56904e144d931042f252cfdc57bdb7ff0","article_path":"articles/v1/c7/bridgford-foods-corporation-common-stock/2010/11/85/85a1b497433afc55e0fc98f12f9b7b953266d9f57e76dd3da31b16437e41ee42